<title>USA: ACT Networks names Michael Gardner as COO.</title>
<headline>ACT Networks names Michael Gardner as COO.</headline>
<dateline>CAMARILLO, Calif 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACT Networks Inc said its board had appointed Michael Gardner as the company's chief operating officer.  </p>
<p>It said Gardner served as president of Whittaker/XYPLEX, an Internet-working and remote access division of California-based Whittaker Corp.</p>
<p>ACT Networks, which develops, manufacturers, markets and sells Frame Relay wide-area network access products for voice, data and integrated network applications, did not say who he would replace.</p>
